{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_06_document_generation_reportcontent", "label": "ReportContent", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md", "source_location": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md:57-67", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The single content contract both renderers consume; adding a field here does not render it automatically, which is the root of several divergence bugs."}, {"id": "docs_06_document_generation_docxgenerator", "label": "DocxGenerator", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md", "source_location": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md:353-381", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Creates a blank docx.Document() and applies CategoryConfig.formatting (margins, styles) while hardcoding many sizes/colors; accepts a template_path it never uses."}, {"id": "docs_06_document_generation_latexgenerator", "label": "LatexGenerator", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md", "source_location": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md:68-79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Converts Markdown to LaTeX and renders the Jinja2 template with LaTeX-safe delimiters, but deliberately takes only report and output_path - it does not accept CategoryConfig, so YAML formatting never reaches the PDF."}, {"id": "docs_06_document_generation_pdfexporter", "label": "PdfExporter", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md", "source_location": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md:425-450", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_06_document_generation_pdf_fallback_chain", "label": "PDF Engine Fallback Chain (Tectonic to XeLaTeX to LibreOffice)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md", "source_location": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md:425-450", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Engine order is hardcoded Tectonic then XeLaTeX/pdflatex then LibreOffice; settings.pdf_engine and pdf_fallback_engine are never read, and metadata.json labels any successful PDF as tectonic/xelatex even when LibreOffice produced it."}, {"id": "docs_06_document_generation_formatting_divergence", "label": "DOCX/PDF Formatting Divergence", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md", "source_location": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md:76-79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Because only DocxGenerator reads CategoryConfig.formatting while report.tex.j2 hardcodes font, size, margins and spacing, changing YAML changes the DOCX only and changing the template changes the PDF only - the two outputs silently diverge."}, {"id": "docs_06_document_generation_markdown_conversion", "label": "Markdown Conversion Rules", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md", "source_location": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md:277-303", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Supports headings, bold/italic/code, lists, quotes, rules, and tables, but no math, no images, no links, no nested lists; math is escaped to literal text because sanitize_math is unused. A separate parser exists for DOCX, so the same body renders differently per format."}, {"id": "docs_06_document_generation_frontpage", "label": "FrontPage", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md", "source_location": "docs/06_DOCUMENT_GENERATION.md:201-222", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Carries institution/university/campus/department, document type, title, subtitle, course, submitted-by/to, date, logo path; the LaTeX title page hardcodes 'Institute of Engineering' instead of 